  {"layer": "fix-ae", "tag": "ae_pack/hud/smg_reticle.bitmap", "op": "bitmap", "art": ["smg_reticle.png"], "arguments": ["-T", "2d_textures", "-F", "dxt5"]},
  {"layer": "fix-ae", "tag": "ae_pack/hud/smg_ammo.weapon_hud_interface", "op": "counter_hud", "alphas": "ae_pack\\hud\\smg_alphas_smooth.bitmap", "meter": "ae_pack\\hud\\smg_meter_smooth.bitmap", "scale": 0.25, "anchor": [-1, 20], "off_screen": [-3000, -3000], "icon_sequence": 0, "from": ["fix-xbox", "ae_pack/hud/smg_ammo.weapon_hud_interface"], "why": "the ammunition panel: the counter of 60 rounds (counter_art.py), the low-ammo flash on it, the prompts' picture off the screen"},
  {"layer": "fix-ae", "tag": "cmt/ui/hudv4.1/weapons/evolved/human/smg.weapon_hud_interface", "op": "edit", "from": ["fix-xbox", "cmt/ui/hudv4.1/weapons/evolved/human/smg.weapon_hud_interface"], "edits": [["erase", "static_elements[*]"], ["erase", "meter_elements[*]"], ["set", "child_hud", "ae_pack/hud/smg_ammo.weapon_hud_interface"], ["set", "crosshairs[0].crosshair_bitmap", "ae_pack\\hud\\smg_reticle.bitmap"], ["sets", [["crosshairs[0].crosshair_overlays[0].flags.not_a_sprite", "1"], ["crosshairs[0].crosshair_overlays[0].sequence_index", "0"], ["crosshairs[0].crosshair_overlays[0].width_scale", "0.0644"], ["crosshairs[0].crosshair_overlays[0].height_scale", "0.0644"], ["crosshairs[0].crosshair_overlays[0].default_color", "0 40 150 255"], ["crosshairs[0].crosshair_overlays[0].flashing_color", "0 255 0 0"], ["crosshairs[0].crosshair_overlays[0].flash_period", "1"], ["crosshairs[0].crosshair_overlays[0].flash_delay", "0"], ["crosshairs[0].crosshair_overlays[0].number_of_flashes", "1"], ["crosshairs[0].crosshair_overlays[0].flash_length", "1"], ["crosshairs[0].crosshair_overlays[0].disabled_color", "0 0 0 0"]]]], "why": "CMT's interface keeps only its crosshair, now our reticle (reticle_art.py, the SMG form, 58 px across on 1080 lines) in CE's colour, red on target, as the battle rifle's; the ammunition panel is the child HUD"},
  {"layer": "fix-ae", "tag": "cmt/weapons/_shared/smg/bitmaps/smg_body_diff.bitmap", "op": "dxt_lift", "lift": 1.8, "from": ["cmt", "cmt/weapons/_shared/smg/bitmaps/smg_body_diff.bitmap"], "why": "CMT's art is dark in stock CE's lighting: the base map brightened as the battle rifle's"},
  {"layer": "fix-ae", "tag": "cmt/weapons/_shared/smg/shaders/smg_body.shader_model", "op": "edit", "from": ["fix-xbox", "cmt/weapons/_shared/smg/shaders/smg_body.shader_model"], "edits": [["sets", [["perpendicular_brightness", "0.75"], ["parallel_brightness", "0.75"], ["perpendicular_tint_color", "1 1 1"], ["parallel_tint_color", "1 1 1"], ["reflection_cube_map", "vehicles\\warthog\\bitmaps\\reflection diffuse metal.bitmap"]]]], "why": "the body's lighting tuned beside the battle rifle's in the game; its reflection cube map was a campaign map's (levels\\a10\\bitmaps\\cube map glass): the warthog's metal cube map, which every stock multiplayer map has, as the battle rifle's metal"},
  {"layer": "fix-ae", "tag": "cmt/weapons/_shared/smg/shaders/smg_attachments_silencer.shader_model", "op": "edit", "from": ["fix-xbox", "cmt/weapons/_shared/smg/shaders/smg_attachments_silencer.shader_model"], "edits": [["set", "reflection_cube_map", "characters\\cyborg\\bitmaps\\cubemap mirror surface.bitmap"]], "why": "its reflection cube map is a campaign map's (levels\\a10\\bitmaps\\cube map glass): the stock cyborg's mirror cube map, which every stock multiplayer map has, as the battle rifle's silencer shader"},
  {"layer": "fix-ae", "tag": "cmt/weapons/_shared/smg/shaders/smg_attachments_scope.shader_model", "op": "edit", "from": ["fix-xbox", "cmt/weapons/_shared/smg/shaders/smg_attachments_scope.shader_model"], "edits": [["set", "reflection_cube_map", "characters\\cyborg\\bitmaps\\cubemap mirror surface.bitmap"]], "why": "its reflection cube map is the grunt's (characters\\grunt\\bitmaps\\reflection grunt diffuse), which no stock multiplayer map has: the stock cyborg's mirror cube map"},
  {"layer": "fix-ae", "tag": "cmt/weapons/_shared/smg/effects/smg_bullet_fire_1.effect", "op": "edit", "from": ["cmt", "cmt/weapons/_shared/smg/effects/smg_bullet_fire_1.effect"], "edits": [["sets", [["events[0].particles[0].radius", "0.031500 0.044143"], ["events[1].particles[0].count", "0 0"]]]], "why": "a smaller muzzle flash, as the battle rifle's (the owner: big beside the pistol's): CMT's two fireballs, first and third person, are one at 0.7 of its size; the sound, smoke and light as they were"},
  {"layer": "fix-ae", "tag": "cmt/weapons/_shared/smg/effects/smg_bullet_fire_2.effect", "op": "edit", "from": ["cmt", "cmt/weapons/_shared/smg/effects/smg_bullet_fire_2.effect"], "edits": [["sets", [["events[0].particles[0].radius", "0.031500 0.044143"], ["events[1].particles[0].count", "0 0"]]]], "why": "a smaller muzzle flash, as the battle rifle's (the owner: big beside the pistol's): CMT's two fireballs, first and third person, are one at 0.7 of its size; the sound, smoke and light as they were"},
  {"layer": "fix-ae", "tag": "cmt/weapons/evolved/smg/smg.weapon", "op": "edit", "from": ["fix-xbox", "cmt/weapons/evolved/smg/smg.weapon"], "edits": [["sets", [["collision_model", "weapons\\assault rifle\\assault rifle.model_collision_geometry"], ["weapon_flags.enables_integrated_night_vision", "0"], ["magazines[0].rounds_total_initial", "180"], ["magazines[0].rounds_reserved_maximum", "180"], ["magazines[0].rounds_loaded_maximum", "60"], ["magazines[0].rounds_reloaded", "60"], ["triggers[0].maximum_rate_of_fire", "15 15"], ["triggers[0].error_angle", "1.5 5.5"], ["triggers[0].minimum_error", "1"], ["triggers[0].error_acceleration_time", "0.8"], ["triggers[0].error_deceleration_time", "0.2"], ["triggers[0].projectiles_between_contrails", "3"], ["triggers[0].firing_noise", "loud"], ["autoaim_angle", "6"], ["autoaim_range", "12"], ["magnetism_angle", "12"], ["magnetism_range", "18"], ["player_melee_damage", "weapons\\assault rifle\\melee.damage_effect"], ["player_melee_response", "weapons\\assault rifle\\melee_response.damage_effect"]]]], "why": "The SMG numbers (brief 2026-10-21): 15 rounds a second, a magazine of 60, 180 rounds to start and 180 in reserve at most (CE's maximum is the reserve alone), error 1 to 2.75 degrees (a shot at least the minimum, 1, off: it fires in the cone between the two as CE does) reached in 1 s and lost in 0.2 s, widened in play (owner 2026-10-21, beside the AR on Octagon: \"a little less tight at range\") to 1.5 to 5.5 degrees reached in 0.8 s (the barrel's error group, +56 / +60; its +72 / +76 pair is the dual-wield ramp), aim assist 6 degrees / 12 units and magnetism 12 / 18, a tracer every 4th round, a loud shot; the held weapon's collision the stock assault rifle's; no night vision (the SMG has a flashlight, as CE's assault rifle); the melee the stock assault rifle's, its damage and response tags left to the map (on every stock multiplayer map): 40 to 60 a blow, 1.4 against a Spartan's shield and body, as every stock weapon's (CMT's melee took 30 flat at 1.0: about five blows from the front where a stock weapon takes two or three)"},
